{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565660/extras/d9545aa046eeed09be689092552c6bc7.avif?t=1768240272\" width=1280 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore</strong> the surrounding desert and use the grappling hook to bring scrap metal back to base. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Races against the clock</strong> await to test your piloting skills. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight in the skies</strong> and complete pirate missions with varied objectives. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perform well and <strong>earn medals</strong> in races and missions, and unlock new crafting recipes to equip your ship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565660/extras/868ecdf56833863c8456f1672d328273.avif?t=1768240272\" width=600 height=240 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565660/extras/41b8d69497eb6ad49c7e71cab62cbebb.webp?t=1768240272\" width=40 height=40 /></span>&quot;&quot;&quot;&quot;&quot;&quot;&quot;&quot;&quot;&quot;&quot;&quot;&quot;&quot;&quot;&quot;&quot;&quot;&quot;&quot;&quot;&quot;&quot;&quot;&quot;&quot;&quot;&quot;&quot;&quot;<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565660/extras/41b8d69497eb6ad49c7e71cab62cbebb.webp?t=1768240272\" width=40 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Solo dev project</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565660/extras/41b8d69497eb6ad49c7e71cab62cbebb.webp?t=1768240272\" width=40 height=40 /></span>&quot;&quot;&quot;&quot;&quot;&quot;&quot;&quot;&quot;&quot;&quot;&quot;&quot;&quot;&quot;<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565660/extras/41b8d69497eb6ad49c7e71cab62cbebb.webp?t=1768240272\" width=40 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Behind Scrap Wings is a very small team: a developer wearing several hats with a good dose of motivation! This is my very first game released on Steam, so please add it to your wishlist to show your support =).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3565660?t=1768240272","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3565660?t=1768240272","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565660/2913df50be18d0ab3517e43bcba97e412f3e3eb5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768240272","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565660/2913df50be18d0ab3517e43bcba97e412f3e3eb5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768240272","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3666290,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565660/extras/d9545aa046eeed09be689092552c6bc7.avif?t=1768240272\" width=1280 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore</strong> the surrounding desert and u